      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "AI Trip Reel Generator",
        "formDescription": "Create a personalized travel Reel from YOUR photos & videos, inspired by a reference Reel. Tip: for the trip media, paste PUBLIC direct links (Google Drive/Dropbox/S3 direct URLs) — one per line — so the render engine can fetch them.",
