        "text": "You are a professional short-form video editor. Analyze this reference Reel ONLY to extract its editing pattern (do NOT describe copyrighted content to reproduce it literally). Return a JSON object describing: overall_style, total_duration_seconds, clip_count, per_clip_durations (array of seconds), pacing (slow/medium/fast), transition_types (array), text_placement_style, effects (array), camera_movement_style, color_grade (mood/LUT feel), music_energy, beat_sync_notes, intro_style, ending_style. Be concise and structural, not a shot-by-shot copy.",
