        "text": "These are a traveler's trip PHOTOS (URLs in order). For EACH photo return a JSON array item with: index, url, subject, scene_type (landscape/food/portrait/action/architecture), visual_quality (1-10), best_moment (true/false), suggested_use (intro/hero/b-roll/ending), notes. Pick the strongest, most visually striking shots as best_moment.",
        "imageUrls": "={{ $json.imageUrlsCsv }}",
        "options": {
          "maxOutputTokens": 2048
        }
      },
