    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
          "cachedResultName": "gemini-2.5-flash"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert AI video editor. Build an ORIGINAL editing timeline for a 9:16 (1080x1920) Instagram Reel using ONLY the traveler's own media. Use the reference recipe ONLY as inspiration for structure, pacing, clip count, transitions, text placement and color mood — DO NOT copy the reference content.\n\nREFERENCE EDITING RECIPE:\n{{ $json.referenceRecipe }}\n\nTRAVELER MEDIA ANALYSIS (choose the best moments; images have url, videos have url + best_segment_start_seconds/end):\n{{ $json.mediaAnalysis }}\n\nAVAILABLE MEDIA URLS (only use these exact URLs):\nimages: {{ $(\"Prepare Inputs\").item.json.imageUrlsCsv }}\nvideos: {{ $(\"Prepare Inputs\").item.json.videoUrlsCsv }}\n\nUSER INSTRUCTIONS (override defaults, e.g. faster / more photos / cinematic / remove text / duration): {{ $(\"Prepare Inputs\").item.json.instructions }}\nTARGET DURATION (seconds): {{ $(\"Prepare Inputs\").item.json.targetDuration }}\n\nOutput STRICT JSON in Shotstack Edit format with this shape:\n{ \"timeline\": { \"background\": \"#000000\", \"tracks\": [ { \"clips\": [ { \"asset\": { \"type\": \"image\"|\"video\", \"src\": \"<one of the media urls>\", \"trim\": <video start sec, videos only> }, \"start\": <sec>, \"length\": <sec>, \"fit\": \"crop\", \"scale\": 1, \"position\": \"center\", \"transition\": { \"in\": \"fade\"|\"slideLeft\"|\"zoom\", \"out\": \"fade\" }, \"effect\": \"zoomIn\"|\"slideUp\" } ] }, { \"clips\": [ { \"asset\": { \"type\": \"title\"|\"html\", \"text\": \"<short caption>\", \"style\": \"minimal\" }, \"start\": <sec>, \"length\": <sec>, \"position\": \"bottom\" } ] } ] } }\nRules: total of all clip lengths on the main track must equal TARGET DURATION. Map clip count and per-clip lengths to match the reference pacing. Put media on track 1 (first) and text captions on track 2. If the user asked to remove text, omit the text track. Only reference URLs that appear in the available media lists. Return ONLY the JSON object."
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a meticulous video-editing planner. You output only valid Shotstack Edit JSON and never copy the reference content, only its editing style.",
          "maxOutputTokens": 4096,
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      },
      "id": "9c547999-9d42-4272-8c93-7392a1683e4b",
      "name": "Build Edit Plan",
